package core

const directiveStateContract = "The directive says what should remain true. Conversation history, recalled memory, and tool records say what already happened. Never use the directive as a run log."

const recurringDirectiveContract = "For recurring work, persist only the responsibility and cadence exactly as the owner stated. Do not invent calendar details or store run dates, due/completion markers, counters, or instructions to update them."

const selfImprovementDirectiveContract = "After completing work, if the outcome reveals a reusable way to fulfill your directive better, call evolve once to retain that improvement in the smallest relevant method or strategy section before pacing. Do not change your role, goals, constraints, permissions, or tools; do not store run history; and do not evolve again until the change has been applied and later experience reveals another improvement."
